WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.086 --> 00:00:11.588
"Mo is in trouble!" Cora thought.

2
00:00:11.589 --> 00:00:13.845
She swam toward Mo.

3
00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:21.159
"Leave him alone!" she yelled.

4
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:27.762
The anglerfish saw the lantern's glow.

5
00:00:27.763 --> 00:00:35.880
"Yikes!" it said. "It's a bigger anglerfish!"

6
00:00:35.881 --> 00:00:39.617
It quickly swam away.

7
00:00:39.618 --> 00:00:42.970
"You saved me!" Mo said.

8
00:00:42.971 --> 00:00:50.783
"Let's go help the plankton."

9
00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:54.306
At the reef the jellyfish were everywhere.

10
00:00:54.307 --> 00:00:57.441
"I don't know what to do," Cora thought.

11
00:00:57.442 --> 00:00:59.773
She looked at the lantern.

12
00:00:59.774 --> 00:01:05.048
It was still glowing brightly.

13
00:01:05.049 --> 00:01:09.313
Cora remembered how the light saved Mo.

14
00:01:09.314 --> 00:01:13.361
She got an idea.

15
00:01:13.362 --> 00:01:17.005
"Look over here, jellyfish!" she called.

16
00:01:17.006 --> 00:01:20.371
Cora held the lantern high.

17
00:01:20.372 --> 00:01:23.225
She swayed it back and forth.

18
00:01:23.226 --> 00:01:27.729
The jellyfish swayed too!

19
00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:30.405
"What are you doing?" Mo asked.

20
00:01:30.406 --> 00:01:35.383
"Jellyfish like lights, Mo," Cora said.

21
00:01:35.384 --> 00:01:39.829
"Watch this!"

22
00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:43.637
Cora carried the lantern away from the reef.

23
00:01:43.638 --> 00:01:47.778
The jellyfish followed!

24
00:01:47.779 --> 00:01:52.307
Cora led them to Jellyfish Bay.

25
00:01:52.308 --> 00:02:03.932
"Good-bye, jellyfish! Here's your home."

26
00:02:03.933 --> 00:02:14.151
Back at the reef, the plankton cheered.

27
00:02:14.152 --> 00:02:22.516
Cora went into her den to get something.

28
00:02:22.517 --> 00:02:25.752
She brought it to Mo.

29
00:02:25.753 --> 00:02:31.423
"Sea glass!" Mo cried. "Thank you, Cora.

30
00:02:31.424 --> 00:02:38.860
You're smart—and the best friend ever!"

